<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Coates division sale proving drawn out.</title>
<headline>Coates division sale proving drawn out.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coates Brothers (South Africa) Ltd said on Friday that negotiations with Valspar Corp on the sale of its can coatings division were talking long than expected.</p>
<p>As a result a general meeting of Coates shareholders planned for June 25 to approve the disposals will not now be held.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
